<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOULOUSE, France 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the</p>
<p>$400,000 men's Toulouse indoor tennis Grand Prix on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat 1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>4-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat 7-Mark Woodforde</p>
<p>(Australia) 2-6 7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
</text>
